    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Crisis Mediator.</strong> You specialize in talking people down from the brink.</p><ul><li>When you resolve a significant scene that could have become a combat encounter (or escalated to violence) using primarily Diplomacy, Performance (Presence), Insight (Soul), or other nonviolent means, you may apply one of the following effects, as appropriate to the fiction:</li><li><strong>• Darkness –1</strong> in the affected hex or faction (to a campaign-appropriate minimum).</li><li><strong>• Soft Power +1 OP</strong> to your faction at the end of the strategic turn.</li></ul><p>You can apply this feature once per scene, and a number of times per Soma Break equal to your tier.</p>",
